[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様？\u3000大丈夫？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you all right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、うん。ちょっと、この暗さが\nあの海を思い出させてね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. It's just... the darkness reminds me of that sea."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでも前へ進めているのですから、\n鍛錬の成果が出ているということでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The fact that you can still move forward shows your training is paying off."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゆっくりでいいんです。進んでいることが素晴らしい。\n私たちもアルビーナさんの歩く速さに合わせましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Take your time. What matters is that you're making progress. We'll match your pace."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。アルビーナ、私たちがついてるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. We're here with you, Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……カロリンさんは強いね。\n今思うと、暗黒の氷海でもぜんぜんビビッてなかったし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Karoline, you're really strong. Now that I think about it, you weren't scared at all in the Dark Frozen Sea."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの光景を見て内心ワーオワオワオと思ってましたよ。\n私はどこの教会にもいる普通のシスターですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, I was screaming internally the whole time. I'm just an ordinary sister you'd find at any church."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "謙遜して……普通のシスターは、\n聖戦士と肩を並べて戦えないわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're being too modest. Ordinary sisters can't fight alongside Sacred Knights."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、戦いのほうは……思いのほかしっくりくる、\n実益を兼ねた趣味ですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, as for the fighting... It turned out to be a surprisingly fitting hobby that also happens to be practical."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私にとって、戦いとは対話と同じなのです。\n時には、言葉で語らうより多くの真実を伝えてくれます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For me, combat is like conversation. Sometimes it reveals more truth than words ever could."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナさんももっと魔物と戦えば\nその果てに見えてくるものが必ずありますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you fight more monsters, Alvina, you'll surely see something beyond it all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええと、拳で語り合う……ってこと？\nカロリンさんって、想像以上に豪快な人だね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, so... communicating with your fists? You're way more intense than I imagined, Karoline."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうです、試しにですけれど\n戦闘中に技名を叫んでみてはいかがでしょうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed! As a trial, why don't you try shouting out your attack names during battle?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "自分の行動を宣言することで\n相手の反応を引き出す対話となりますし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By declaring your actions, you draw out your opponent's response—it becomes a dialogue."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何より必殺技を叫ぶのは\n気合が入って勇気が出るものですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And more importantly, shouting your finishing move pumps you up and gives you courage."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなものかな……\nじゃあ、試しに、ゴホンッ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder if that's really true... Well, let me try. *Ahem*"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ブランディッシュソーン！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brandish Thorn!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "スパイラルロンド！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Spiral Rondo!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "メイルシュトローム！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maelstrom!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "トゥインクルスラスト！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Twinkle Thrust!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ワイルドローズ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wild Rose!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これ、めちゃくちゃハズいんだけど！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is SO embarrassing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "命を懸けた勝負中ではないからですよ。\nそのうち、癖になってきますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's because it's not a life-or-death battle. You'll get used to it eventually."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしは結構好きだけどなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I actually kinda like it though."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これで気合が入るかどうかは、人によるかもね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whether it pumps you up probably depends on the person..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また来た！\u3000カロリンさん、せっかくだから\n必殺技のお手本、見せてくれません？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "More enemies! Karoline, since we're at it, why don't you show us a demonstration?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "承知いたしました。ごほん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Very well. *Ahem*"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クーゲルウルタイル！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kugel Urteil!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゲベートシュテルン！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gebet Stern!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シュヴェーアシュルト！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Schwer Schuld!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおっ！\u3000すごい迫力……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow! That was intense..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "伝わってくる……カロリンの熱い言葉",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can feel it... Karoline's passionate words."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おっと……まだ対話の途中でしたのに。\n果ててしまわれましたか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my... we were still in the middle of our dialogue. Did they pass on already?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "カロリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Karoline"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "言い方こわ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That phrasing is terrifying..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "カロリンさんは敵に回しちゃいけないね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Note to self: never make an enemy of Karoline..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]